  "description": "MCP server exposing OHDSI OMOP standardized medical vocabularies to LLM agents — search, map, and navigate 11M+ concepts across 120+ vocabularies including SNOMED CT, ICD-10, LOINC and RxNorm. Supports semantic and multilingual search, cross-vocabulary mappings, hierarchy navigation, and FHIR-to-OMOP resolution. MIT-licensed TypeScript, with stdio and Streamable HTTP transports. Part of OMOPHub's SDK family (Python, Node, R). Important: the server is an open-source client to OMOPHub's hosted, proprietary REST API (api.omophub.com) — it requires an OMOPHub account and API key to function, and offers no self-hosted or offline vocabulary option.",
